      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OTTO ROSE (1) ran a good time (34.58) when second a Restricted WIN H at Sandown after jumping from this box. Should be in this for a long way. FURIOUS FALCON (4) failed to feature last start after missing the jump at Sandown, but prior to that won comfortably by 3.5 lengths at Sandown (29.85) beating Scott Vicious in a Grade 5 on September 17. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Has the ability to give this a shake. ASTON BUGSY (8) is yet to miss the placings here in an excellent record which boasts two wins and two placings. Below best last time at Bendigo (24.21) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 5 length fifth. Can feature in the finish. JOEY (2) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
